# Tooling / working documents / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.claude/
/HyrumHaircuts-Claude-Code-Build-Prompt.md
/HyrumHaircuts-Claude-Code-Build-Prompt-v2.md
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log

